<newsitem itemid="184713" id="root" date="1996-11-12" xml:lang="en">
<title>GERMANY: Adidas details 1996 nine-month results.</title>
<headline>Adidas details 1996 nine-month results.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net income per ordinary share  7.14    vs 5.54 marks</p>
<p>    Group net income			   324     vs 251</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     436     vs 303</p>
<p>    Group financial expenses		 12	vs 44</p>
<p>    Group royalty and commission income  72	vs 71</p>
<p>    Group income from operations	   376     vs 275</p>
<p>    Group selling, administrative costs  1,074   vs 816</p>
<p>    Group gross profit			 1,492   vs 1,129</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,714   vs 2,841</p>
<p>    Group inventories			  828     vs 608</p>
<p>    Group receivables, current assets    1,074   vs 802</p>
<p>    Group total current assets	     1,956   vs 1,460</p>
<p>    Group total assets			 2,372   vs 1,788</p>
<p>    Group working capital		    585     vs 408</p>
<p>    Group net borrowings		     506     vs 490</p>
<p>    Group total liabilities		  1,437   vs 1,188</p>
<p>    Group shareholder equity		 905     vs 578</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear maker is Adidas AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
